          "html": "<b>Источники.</b> <a href=\"https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/udp.7.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">udp(7)</a> · <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8201\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">RFC 8201: PMTUD</a> · <a href=\"https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man8/ip-netns.8.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ip-netns(8)</a>."
